#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=decisions
# The 奏 page (the bottom bar's 奏, opened at the start here): the cards waiting for alice one at a time, the chat's
# title over the post and its options; one tapped answers it and the page says none are left.
timeout 60000
log do: peer send 还有一个问题 {T} card:发布到哪里 {T}|测试版 {T}*|正式版 {T}
timeout 120000
until =测试版 {T}
shot 1-deck
tap =测试版 {T}
until 奏折已全部批完
shot 2-idle
